## SQ-NCH-01 | NCH numeric defaults: no empty-stack error, sawdust smelts in 10 s
@group A
@commands After boot grep `logs/latest.log` and `logs/kubejs/server.log` for `Can't modify the empty stack`; sawdust in a furnace with fuel; JEI Smelting page for sawdust
@pass no hits; ash after 10 s; JEI shows 10 s, not 0
@fails Depends on: `food/drinks #12` (NCH `_or` replaces numeric `??` defaults)
@from batches/r1101/p1_server.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
bootreject Can't modify the empty stack
kjsreject Can't modify the empty stack
> cdevtest rdetail sawdust
> setblock 70 -60 0 minecraft:furnace{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"immersiveengineering:dust_wood",Count:1b},{Slot:1b,id:"minecraft:coal",Count:1b}]}
sleep 12
> data get block 70 -60 0 Items
look sawdust smelting recipe cookingtime 200; the furnace output slot (Slot 2b) holds ash after 12 s
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

## SQ-GT-31 | felsic helmet reach potion mB from config
@group A
@commands grep the log for `[NCH.cfg] no CEConfig.CRAFTING.FELSIC_`; set `[crafting.felsic_helmet] reachPotionMb = 100`, `/reload`; revert after
@pass no missing-key lines; log shows `CRAFTING.FELSIC_HELMET.reachMb overridden: default 500 -> 100`; recipe has a 100 mB Long Reach fill and a 500 mB Magic Resistance fill
@fails Depends on: `gear/tuning #6`
@from batches/r1101/p1_server.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
bootreject \[NCH.cfg\] no CEConfig.CRAFTING.FELSIC_
shell python3 $INST/tools/scratch_query/qrun.py toml config/creativeengineering-common.toml crafting.felsic_helmet reachPotionMb 100
> reload
waitlog (Reloaded|reload)
sleep 5
expect CRAFTING.FELSIC_HELMET.reachMb overridden: default 500 -> 100
> cdevtest rdetail felsic_helmet
shell sed -i '/reachPotionMb = 100/d' config/creativeengineering-common.toml
look recipe shows a 100 mB Long Reach fill and a 500 mB Magic Resistance fill; if the override line is missing, the toml change is not re-read on /reload (record, check on the p1b restart)
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

