## SQ-SSP-01 | cutting board: potato and sweet potato give 3 slices each (board at 125; the slicer half: s3_skip.md)
@group A
@commands knife on a cutting board with a potato, then a sweet potato; Slice & Dice slicer with a knife over a depot, 1 potato then 1 sweet potato
@pass board and slicer each give 3 Potato Slices and 3 Sliced Sweet Potatoes; no recipe error for `creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/potato_slices` or `.../sliced_sweet_potato`
@fails Depends on: `dishes/ingredients #20`
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> cdevtest rdetail farmersdelightcutting/potato_slices
> cdevtest rdetail farmersdelightcutting/sliced_sweet_potato
> setblock 125 -60 500 farmersdelight:cutting_board
> pbot spawn ssp 125 -60 504 minecraft:overworld survival
> pbot hold ssp minecraft:potato
> pbot use ssp 125 -60 500 up
> pbot hold ssp farmersdelight:iron_knife
> pbot use ssp 125 -60 500 up
sleep 2
> cdevtest items 125 -60 500 4
> clear ssp rusticdelight:potato_slices 0
> pbot hold ssp veggiesdelight:sweet_potato
> pbot use ssp 125 -60 500 up
> pbot hold ssp farmersdelight:iron_knife
> pbot use ssp 125 -60 500 up
sleep 2
> cdevtest items 125 -60 500 4
> clear ssp creativeengineering:sliced_sweet_potato 0
expect id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/potato_slices serializer=
expect id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/sliced_sweet_potato serializer=
reject (?i)(error|exception).*(potato_slices|sliced_sweet_potato)
> pbot remove ssp
look 3 Potato Slices, then 3 Sliced Sweet Potatoes: the verb=items count of each plus the bot's "Found N" (it can pick up drops)
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

